{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfea Build &amp; Manage Your Dream Video Game Store!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage the last videogame store left in town. Do you have what it takes to be the game retail tycoon?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plan Your Day</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start each day by checking your trusty calendar for what's ahead. Whether it\u2019s a new game release, a fresh gaming system, or a new type of furniture, staying informed is key. Watch out for special events; hot releases bring in excited customers, while certain days might attract more troublemakers. A well-prepared shop owner always stays ahead! <br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349970/extras/Calendar.gif?t=1744972656\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Buy Games and Hardware</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every morning, _The Merchant_ stops by with his van full of unlockable goodies\u2014new game licenses, consoles, and peripherals. Once you\u2019ve unlocked the latest stock, head to your PC, browse your catalogue, and order what you need to keep your store fully stocked for the day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349970/extras/boxes.gif?t=1744972656\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stock the Shelves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With fresh inventory and shelves ready at your store\u2019s door, it\u2019s time to get everything in place! Organize your shelves efficiently before opening and restock throughout the day to keep up with demand. A well-stocked store means happy customers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349970/extras/stocking.gif?t=1744972656\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Run the Register</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s time for the Grand Opening! Customers will rush in to grab their favourite games\u2014scan their items, process their payments, and keep the line moving. But don\u2019t keep them waiting too long! Impatient shoppers will walk out empty-handed if you fail to check them out in time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349970/extras/man_the_till.gif?t=1744972656\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Defend Your Store</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Not everyone is here to shop. Some shady characters are eyeing your stock, and it\u2019s up to you to stop them before they make off with your best-selling items. Equip yourself with your new favourite tool: <i>The Bat</i>, and protect your store from losses! <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349970/extras/thief_final_hd.gif?t=1744972656\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Expand and Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your business grows, so does your store! Expand to fit more shelves, attract more customers, and reorganize your layout to maximize efficiency. Show off your management skills and prove you can run the biggest, best game store in town! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349970/extras/expand_2.gif?t=1744972656\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349970?t=1744972656","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744972656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349970/70d3a7438ae99486dd0cc7f98a276dbb115e3cb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744972656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349970/70d3a7438ae99486dd0cc7f98a276dbb115e3cb4/capsule_18